prompt.description:
Prompt sent to the LLM as the user message. Supports {{variable}}
interpolation from input_data, node_outputs, variables, and context.
If omitted, defaults to "Process the following data".

AppointmentOperations.description:
Appointment operations:
- `create` — POST /user/create_calendar_event  {event_payload: {...}}
- `update` — POST /user/update_calendar_event  {event_payload: {...}}
- `fetch`  — POST /user/calendar/events/json   (JSON body with snake_case fields)
- `delete` — POST /user/delete_calendar_event   {event_payload: {event_id: "..."}}
- `search` — POST /user/calendar/events/json   (JSON body with date range filters)
